{title: Humsafar}
{artist: Badrinath Ki Dulhaniya Akhil Sachdeva}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
Sun [G] zaalima mere,        Sanu koi [C] darr na
Ki [G] samjhega zamaa [C] na,        Oh [G] tu vi si kamli
Main [C] vi sa kamla,        Ishqe [G] da rog sayaana
Ishqe [C] da rog sayaana,        [G] Sun mere humsa [C] far
Kya tujhe [G] itni si bhi kha [C] bar,        [G] Sun mere humsa [C] far
Kya tujhe [G] itni si bhi kha [C] bar,        Ki teri [G] saanse chalti ji [C] dhar
Rahunga [D] bas wahin umra [G] bhar,        Rahunga [Bm] bas wahin umra [G] bhar haaye
[Em] Jitni haseen ye mulakaa [Bm] tein hai,        [C] Unse bhi pyaari teri baa [G] tein hai
[Em] Baaton mein teri jo kho [Bm] jaate hai,        Aaun na [Am] hosh mein main [G] kabhi
Baahon mein hai [Am] teri zinda [G] gi haaye,        [G] Sun mere humsa [C] far
Kya tujhe [G] itni si bhi kha [C] bar,        Zaalima tere ishqch main
Ho gayiaan kamli haye,        [G] Main toh yoon khada kis
[G] Soch mein pada tha,        [C] Kaise jee raha tha main [D] deewana
[G] Chupke se aake tune,        [G] Dil mein samaa ke tune
[Bm] Chhed diya [C] kaisa ye [D] fasana,        Oh [Em] muskurana bhi tujhi se [Bm] seekha hai
[C] Dil lagaane ka tu hi ta [G] reeka hai,        [Em] Aitbaar bhi tujhi se [Bm] hota hai
Aaun na [Am] hosh mein main [G] kabhi,        Baahon mein hai [Am] teri zinda [G] gi haaye
[G] Hai nahi tha [C] pata,        Ke tujhe [G] maan loonga [C] khuda
Ki teri [G] galiyon mein is [C] kadar,        [D] Aaunga har [G] peher
[G] Sun mere humsa [C] far,        Kya tujhe [G] itni si bhi kha [C] bar
Ki teri [G] saanse chalti ji [C] dhar,        Rahunga [D] bas wahin umra [G] bhar
Rahunga [Bm] bas wahin umra [G] bhar, haaye
